lwext4 (BSD-licensed)

This program bundles the lwext4 ext2/3/4 filesystem library in the `lwext4/`
subdirectory (upstream gkostka/lwext4, tag v1.0.0, commit 890484c), WITH
numbered fixes and additions, each marked "ext4edit patch N" where it sits
and explained with its diff in LWEXT4_UPSTREAM.md.  lwext4's own files are
NOT covered by this program's licence; they carry lwext4's BSD licence,
reproduced here and retained in every lwext4 source file:

