Files this program's patches add to lwext4 (GPL-2.0-or-later, ours)

    lwext4/include/ext4_inline.h, lwext4/src/ext4_inline.c
        the ext4 inline_data feature (patch 7)
    lwext4/include/ext4_casefold.h, lwext4/src/ext4_casefold.c
        the ext4 casefold feature (patch 8)
    lwext4/unicode/config.h, ext2_fs.h, ext2fs.h, ext2fsP.h
        stand-in headers that let e2fsprogs' folding code build without
        e2fsprogs' own build (patch 8)

These are covered by this program's licence above, as their headers state.

e2fsprogs' Unicode folding (GNU GPL)

    lwext4/unicode/nls_utf8.c, utf8n.h, utf8data.h

Mirrored verbatim from e2fsprogs 1.47.4 (lib/ext2fs), bar one exported
wrapper marked in nls_utf8.c; (c) SGI and Collabora Ltd., under the GNU
General Public License as their headers state.

